        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>LCN 1461 Commercial  Door Closer </b>\r\n<p>\r\nThe LCN 1461 door closer features a slimline design that fits narrow head frames and top rails. Commercial heavy duty cast iron cylinder for exceptional service life. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nThe LCN 1461 is UL-listed for use on fire-rated doors and is supplied standard with All Weather Hydraulic Fluid to eliminate seasonal adjustment with temperature change. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nNon handed closer mounts hinge side, top jamb or parallel arm on either right or left swinging doors.  Adjustable spring size 1-6  for interior doors up to 60\" wide and exterior doors to 48\" wide. Shipped with regular arm, a slim line plastic\r\ncover, and self reaming and tapping mounting screws. \r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features and Specifications</b> of The LCN 1461 Door Closer\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Adjustable closing speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable latching speed</li>\r\n<li>Adjustable back check</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Size: 60\" Interior / 48\" Exterior</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Opening:  Up to 180º with Regular Arm</li>\r\n<li>Maximum Door Weight: 258 lbs</li>\r\n<li>Spring Tension: Adjustable 1-6</li>\r\n<li><b>Tri packed for regular, top jamb or parallel arm mounting</b></li>\r\n<li>Non Handed</li>\r\n<li><b>Optional Hold Open and Cushion Arm</b></li>\r\n<li><b>Certified Grade 1</b> for 10 Million Cycles</li>\r\n<li>Cast Iron Housing</li>\r\n<li>Forged Steel Arm</li>\r\n<li>All Weather Fluid</li>\r\n<li>30 Year Warranty</li>\r\n<li>UL 10C Approved</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"/pages/ada-compliant\">ADA Compliant</a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/1460.pdf?v=1704262192\" target=\"new\"><b>LCN 1461 Information (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/handicap-logo.jpg?v=1704353001\" width=\"100\" height=\"98\" border=\"0\" alt=\"ADA Compliant Handicap Logo\">\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<i>NOTE: the standard arm shown in the upper right product image is already included.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\nOptional  <a href=\"/products/hold-open-arm-for-lcn-1461-lcn-1460-3049\"><b>Hold-Open Arm</b></a>, \r\n<a href=\"/products/cush-n-stop-arm-for-lcn-1461-lcn-1460-3077cns\"><b>Cushion Arm</b></a> or \r\n<a href=\"/products/hold-open-cush-n-stop-arm-for-lcn-1461-closer-lcn-1460-3049cns\"><b>Hold-Open Cushion Arm</b></a>  are available if desired.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/kaba-3001-size.gif?v=1704354504\" width=\"450\" height=\"150\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Door Closer Accessories\">\r\n</p>",
